{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-03-28 08:30:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PROVIDES COMPLIMENTARY ACCESS OF FORESIGHT SECURITY TO CHARITIES OPERATING IN UKRAINE AND EASTERN EUROPE TO SUPPORT HUMANITARIAN EFFORTS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TO AID IN THE SUPPORT OF CHARITIES OPERATING IN UKRAINE AND EASTERN EUROPE, S&P GLOBAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE IS OFFERING COMPLIMENTARY ACCESS TO FORESIGHT SECURITY PLANNING CAPABILITIES TO ORGANIZATIONS OPERATING IN THE REGION. SELECT HUMANITARIAN AID ORGANIZATIONS WILL HAVE ACCESS TO LOCATION-SPECIFIC SECURITY AND INTELLIGENCE INFORMATION, ENABLING THE ORGANIZATIONS TO MONITOR THE RAPIDLY CHANGING OPERATIONAL ENVIRONMENT TO ASSIST IN THEIR EFFORTS.'}